From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 3ds-d2 <3ds-d2@localhost>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:19:55 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] shims (window, locale, gdi32): explicit uint32_t lambda
 return types

On newlib uint32_t is unsigned long, so lambdas mixing 'return 0u;' with a
uint32_t value no longer deduce one return type. Same code on glibc.
---
 src/runtime/win32_shims_gdi32.cpp  | 72 +++++++++++++++---------------
 src/runtime/win32_shims_locale.cpp | 72 +++++++++++++++---------------
 src/runtime/win32_shims_window.cpp | 62 ++++++++++++-------------
 3 files changed, 103 insertions(+), 103 deletions(-)

